# ---- PAD-722: a FILM completed, as on LE 1.06 (PAD-428). The collect 0x1cf08c(film, part) (the LE's 0x1d0918, the
# same code) calls 0x1d3134(film) once, the moment the film's fourth part is in (0x1cefec(film) = all four). Films in
# the game's order: 0 Dr. No, 1 From Russia With Love, 2 Goldfinger, 3 Thunderball, 4 You Only Live Twice,
# 5 Diamonds Are Forever. Seen in the emulator 2026-10-25 (an instrument calling the collect for From Russia With
# Love's four parts): a blocks mode on film_frwl started 119 ms after the fourth; on the port without these lines
# nothing started.
site film_complete   0x001d3134 0xe92d4038 0xe1a05000
event film_dr_no        site film_complete arg 0
event film_frwl         site film_complete arg 1
event film_goldfinger   site film_complete arg 2
event film_thunderball  site film_complete arg 3
event film_yolt         site film_complete arg 4
event film_daf          site film_complete arg 5

